  <property name="whatsThis">
   <string>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Model Properties&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Edit the current model's publication details and comments on the Summary tab. Measurements and Parts provide read-only information. Choose OK to apply the metadata changes, or Cancel to discard them.&lt;/p&gt;</string>
